{"version":1,"content":"<p>亞馬遜創始人傑夫·貝索斯敦促英偉達董事會在為黃仁勳物色長期繼任者時，應優先考慮內部人選。當地時間周二，在「矽谷與世界」（Silicon Valley &amp; The World）大會上，貝索斯在一次訪談中表示，如果董事會不讓黃仁勳回歸，那麼英偉達就應該在公司內部尋找繼任者。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586900.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.548657+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:25:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"628a9ec6f67e72f6357254eeeab0b749986d632a51e27915f66f3420a8050a2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}